ction 1830, pp.52–56; candidate missing from the current list. Sarıoğlu lists al-Risāla al-Zāhira separately from al-Risāla al-Bāhira (W034) and Risāla fī fasād al-abḥāth (W040); do not merge the three based only on similar dialectic wording.\n13. المغني → W190; Al-Mughnī fī ʿilm al-jadal wa-ādāb al-baḥth wa-l-munāẓara.\n14. تهذيب النكت → W039; Arif Hikmat Library, Medina, 84 leaves; catalogue reports a copy dated 800 AH, not composition.\n15. حاشية شرح الملخص → не принят / вне предметного охвата; Explicitly attributed by this source to Najm al-Dīn Muḥammad b. Muḥammad al-Lābūdī al-Dimashqī (d.621 AH), not Abhari. Exclude from Abhari works.\n16. كشف الحقائق في تحرير الدقائق → W033; Logic, metaphysics and natural philosophy; Dār al-Kutub al-Miṣriyya MS 162 and Tehran University microfilm 1345; also part of Majlis MS 2752 codex.\n17. منتهى الأفكار في إبانة الأسرار → W187; Logic, metaphysics and natural philosophy; first Muntahā recension, part of Majlis MS 2752.\n18. منتهى الأفكار في إبانة الأسرار → O040; The source calls this the second recension of the logic section of item 17. Fener also calls it a revised/later logic recension with authorial changes. Represent as a recension/expression relation unless distinct work-level evidence emerges.\n19. خلاصة الأفكار ونقاوة الأسرار → W043; In logic; part of Majlis MS 2752.\n20. دقائق الأفكار → W234; In logic, part of Majlis MS 2752. Add as a missing work candidate; Mohaqqeq says the attribution is probable, not certain.\n21. عنوان الحق وبرهان الصدق → W235; Logic, natural philosophy and metaphysics; part of Majlis MS 2752. Add as a missing work candidate; Mohaqqeq's attribution is explicitly tentative.\n22. غاية الإدراك في دراية الأفلاك → не принят / вне предметного охвата; University MS 1082 is anonymous; University microfilm catalogue excerpts quote an item from ‘the book of Imam Athīr al-Dīn al-Abharī’ with this title. Tentative astronomy-corpus candidate, outside strict logic/philosophy scope.\n23. رساله من پرکار القطوع 